{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2022-06-08 17:30:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES THE ACQUISITION OF\xa0PROFITS CREATION CORP. BY BROWN & BROWN DEALER SERVICES', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., JUNE 08, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J. SCOTT PENNY, CHIEF ACQUISITIONS OFFICER OF BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO), AND GERRY WHITE, OWNER OF PROFITS CREATION CORP. (“PROFITS CREATION”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BROWN & BROWN DEALER SERVICES (“BBDS”) HAS ACQUIRED SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ASSETS OF PROFITS CREATION.'}